@* A command of the AddAgent wizard, in OE's OmniCodeBlock (recette R-400): the package's code surface and
   copy button, readable in the light and the dark theme. Recette R-516: a labelled command is a titled
   block (the title, the copy button at its end, then the command); only one without a label stays on
   OE's one-line form. *@
<OmniCodeBlock Code="@Code" Title="@Label" Inline="@(InlineLine && Label is null)" Wrap="@(!InlineLine)"
               Class="wizard-code-block" OnCopy="@OnCopied" />
